            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Display Toggle 1.01

## Improvements

- The menu refreshes immediately when displays connect, disconnect, or change
  configuration.
- Only displays currently available to macOS appear in the menu.
- Stale display entries left behind after a display is disconnected are removed.

Requires macOS 13 Ventura or later. A purchase includes updates through Display
Toggle 2.x.
]]></description>
